# Verification screenshots, regenerated by scripts/shoot-*.mjs and verify-*.mjs.
#
# One frame per sprint of the Explore run is kept, under docs/evidence/. The
# kill criteria in docs/EXPLORE-MODE-PLAN.md are visual, so the closing report
# has to point at the frames it was judged on rather than at a rebuild that
# might not reproduce them. The rest of shots/ is disposable.
